From: Adam Duskett <adam.duskett@amarulasolutions.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jun 2026 09:40:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] allow mount anyfile

Allow mount to mount anyfile. Needed for the overlayfs.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]

Signed-off-by: Adam Duskett <adam.duskett@amarulasolutions.com>
---
 policy/modules/system/mount.te | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/policy/modules/system/mount.te b/policy/modules/system/mount.te
index c5727585c..7b5054e92 100644
--- a/policy/modules/system/mount.te
+++ b/policy/modules/system/mount.te
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ policy_module(mount)
 ## Allow the mount command to mount any directory or file.
 ## </p>
 ## </desc>
-gen_tunable(allow_mount_anyfile, false)
+gen_tunable(allow_mount_anyfile, true)
 
 attribute_role mount_roles;
 roleattribute system_r mount_roles;
